'''Crazed Fish Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by completing the event stage [[Fish Hell (Insane)|The Crazed Fish]] appearing on the '''21st''' of every month. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases health and damage. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], you can get him from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] after completing [[Cosmic Lounge (Cats of the Cosmos)|Cosmic Club]] in Ch. 3 Interstellar Invasion. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], the stage where you can obtain this unit appears every '''Thursday'''.

