==Trivia==
*Crazed Fish Cat is the only [[:Category:Crazed Cats|Crazed Cat]] with a lower cost than its [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|normal self]].
**This trait is also shared by its [[Brainwashed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed]] counterpart.
*Prior to [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]], Crazed Fish Cat's description claimed to have reduced production time instead of cost. Its old descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Crazed Fish Cat
Strong against Red enemies.
Crazed version decreases production time.
Might perform critical attacks</pre>
<pre>Crazed Whale Cat
Managed to become a carnivorous whale.
Strong against Red enemies.
Might perform critical attacks</pre>
<pre>Manic Island Cat
Demons are rumored to live on this manic
island. Strong against Red, might critical.
Mania gives it extra offense and defense!</pre>

* In The Battle Cats Unite! and The Battle Cats POP!, the description for Crazed Fish Cat says it decreases production time rather than reducing cost.

